<title>UK: UK's Heron in 200 mln stg land development project.</title>
<headline>UK's Heron in 200 mln stg land development project.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unlisted UK property company Heron International said on Wednesday that a 200 million stg land development project located near Chepstow, South Wales, will create 2,000 new homes.  </p>
<p>Heron said in a statement that the project would also create 2.5 million square feet of industrial and commercial space and extensive community facilities on a 500 acre site.</p>
<p>It also said the project could create up to 2,500 jobs in the local region over the next seven years.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
